@title Hide cross references of one coil or a whole page on screen, from View > Cross references (1366x768)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# View > Cross references holds the three commands. Hiding a coil's references removes its table and the coil location next to its contacts; hiding a page removes them all on that page. Both are kept in the project, undo, and show a status bar chip that brings them back. The PDF still prints them.
open qa/fixtures/contact-mirror.kopercad
wait 30
key PageDown
wait 10
shot full
click_text "View"
wait 15
click_text "Cross references"
wait 15
shot view-menu-cross-references
key Escape
key Escape
wait 10
click 170 345
wait 30
shot coil-selected
key ctrl+k
wait 10
text hide cross references of the selected
wait 10
key Enter
wait 30
shot coil-references-hidden
key ctrl+k
wait 10
text hide cross references on this page
wait 10
key Enter
wait 30
shot page-references-hidden
check_layout
